---
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, TEAMS_PRICE, OWNER_NAME, TEAMS_EMAIL_URL } from '../consts';
---

<section class="container hero">
  <div class="intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">AI the vL Way for Teams</p>
    <h1>Your departments finish the job together, in one place.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Today each person has a private AI chat, and work gets lost between them in email. I put your team
      in one shared room on EdubaWare, on a template built to show everyone what's in,
      what's missing and who does what next.
    </p>
    <p class="lede">
      I build the template once. The next team starts from the same room, with the same steps and the
      same checks.
    </p>
  </div>
  <aside class="price depth-box" aria-label="What it costs to start">
    <p class="amount">{TEAMS_PRICE}</p>
    <p class="per">per seat, per month</p>
    <a class="button button-edubaware door-button" href={TEAMS_EMAIL_URL}>Email Jeff about my team</a>
    <p class="small">Send the word TEAMS to {CONTACT_EMAIL}.</p>
    <p class="small">One seat is one person. A template is the steps, rules and files for one kind of job. Custom setup and new templates are priced after we look at the job.</p>
  </aside>
  <p class="credit">
    I'm {OWNER_NAME}, one of Jake Van Clief's 7 Masters of ICM. I have won three ICM competitions. I have been a teacher for over 24 years and am now an executive at a home builder, where I have started teaching AI to the staff and build the workflows and tools they use. This work uses ICM Principles by Jake Van Clief. ICM structure has folders and files that show AI where to look.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 3fr) minmax(0, 2fr);
    gap: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: var(--space-7);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .intro {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--edubaware);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    color: var(--edubaware);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4.2vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .lede {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .price {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background: var(--white);
    border: 3px solid var(--edubaware);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .amount {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--edubaware);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .per {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .small {
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .credit {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: var(--space-3);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--edubaware);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      padding-top: var(--space-4);
    }

    .lede {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .price {
      padding: var(--space-3);
    }

    .amount {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .per {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 400px) {
    .hero {
      gap: var(--space-3);
      padding-top: var(--space-3);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    h1 {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
      font-size: 1.45rem;
    }

    .lede {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
  }
  .lede + .lede {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }
</style>
